  "description": "The broader stereotype that vehicle owners, particularly of large trucks or muscle cars, often take pride in their vehicles to such an extent that they may refuse to be photographed or acknowledge their car's presence. This stereotype is often used humorously in memes to exaggerate the owner's attachment to their vehicle.",
